Package: shotgunNFreports
Title: Reporting Utilities for Shotgun-NF Metagenomics Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Fereshteh", "Izadi", email = "fereshteh.izadi@surrey.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Parses Shotgun-NF output directories and generates reproducible summary tables, quality-control metrics, taxonomic profiles, functional profiles, MAG quality summaries, AMR summaries, BGC summaries, and runtime visualisations.
